  "description": "<style type=\"text/css\">.text-subtle {\r\n    color: #536b75;\r\n  }\r\n  .grid { \r\n    display: grid; \r\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr; \r\n    gap: 2rem; \r\n    margin: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem; \r\n  }\r\n  .grid img { \r\n    aspect-ratio: 500 / 333; \r\n    width: 100%; \r\n    border-radius: 8px; \r\n    object-fit: cover; \r\n  }\r\n  .grid-item h4 { \r\n    margin: 1rem 0 0.5rem; \r\n    font-weight: 600; \r\n    font-size: 1.125rem; \r\n  }\r\n  \r\n  @media (min-width: 600px) {\r\n    .grid { \r\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; \r\n    }\r\n    .grid-item-centered {\r\n      grid-column: 1 / -1;\r\n      width: 50%;\r\n      justify-self: center;\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n</style>\r\n<div class=\"experience-description\">⭐ <strong><em>Timewalk: Walk Through 12,000 Years of Human History</em></strong>– Journey through the civilisations of the Maya, Babylon, Ancient Egypt, Rapa Nui and Göbeklitepe in a once-in-a-lifetime cultural experience for all generations. Featuring stunning 360° environments, cutting-edge spatial audio and an original orchestral score, this multisensory journey is narrated by David Schofield and Olivia Williams and designed by more than 250 award-winning immersive artists, designers and composers.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>🚨Timewalk is now open! Be the first to walk through 12,000 years of human history this Summer.</strong><br>\r\n<!-- Grid 5 Images -->\r\n<div class=\"grid\">\r\n<div class=\"grid-item\"><img alt=\"The Maya\" src=\"https://images.feverup.com/plan/photo/b96f2cdc-90b3-11f1-bf35-c658d08d71fa.jpg\">\r\n<h4>The Maya</h4>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-subtle\">Step deep into lush jungle temples to decode astronomical mysteries and ancient spiritual rituals.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"grid-item\"><img alt=\"Babylon\" src=\"https://images.feverup.com/plan/photo/b975cc5e-90b3-11f1-bf35-c658d08d71fa.jpg\">\r\n<h4>Babylon</h4>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-subtle\">Pass beneath the legendary blue-glazed Ishtar Gate and marvel at the splendour of ancient Mesopotamia.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"grid-item\"><img alt=\"Ancient Egypt\" src=\"https://images.feverup.com/plan/photo/b7d12af6-90b3-11f1-bf35-c658d08d71fa.jpg\">\r\n<h4>Ancient Egypt</h4>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-subtle\">Sail down the majestic Nile at sunset and uncover the eternal wonders and sacred monuments of the Pharaohs.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"grid-item\"><img alt=\"Rapa Nui\" src=\"https://images.feverup.com/plan/photo/b97ca9fc-90b3-11f1-bf35-c658d08d71fa.jpg\">\r\n<h4>Rapa Nui</h4>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-subtle\">Stand face-to-face with the towering Moai statues and unlock the secrets of Easter Island.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"grid-item grid-item-centered\"><img alt=\"Göbeklitepe\" src=\"https://images.feverup.com/plan/photo/b9832b06-90b3-11f1-bf35-c658d08d71fa.jpg\">\r\n<h4>Göbeklitepe</h4>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-subtle\">Explore the world's oldest known temple complex and witness the very dawn of human civilisation.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\r\n🌍 Become a Timewalker and journey through 12,000 years of human history in one unforgettable immersive experience<br>\r\n🏛️ Explore five world-changing civilisations, from the Maya and Babylon to Ancient Egypt, Rapa Nui and Göbeklitepe<br>\r\n✨ Discover 21 ancient civilisations brought to life through cinematic storytelling, never-before-seen environments and cutting-edge technology<br>\r\n🧠 Created by 15 times globally awarded DEM Museums, team behind some of the world’s leading immersive cultural experiences<br>\r\n🌌 Step inside awe-inspiring worlds where monumental architecture, forgotten myths and everyday life are recreated at extraordinary scale<br>\r\n🎧 Experience world-class projection technology, immersive soundscapes and emotionally powerful storytelling unlike anywhere else in London<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br>\r\n🕒 Opening hours: Monday–Sunday from 10 AM – 7 PM, please note that the venue will close 1 hour after the last session time.<br>\r\n⏳ Duration: approx 60 minutes<br>\r\n📍 Location: Immerse LDN<br>\r\n👤 Age requirement: All ages are welcome! Children aged 0–3 enter free of charge. Please note that the experience includes loud sound, so parental supervision is recommended.<br>\r\n♿ Accessibility: the venue is wheelchair accessible<br>\r\n❄️ The venue is air-conditioned throughout<br>\r\n🌐 Languages: available in 25 languages + specially created child-friendly narration<br>\r\n🎁 Gift memories to someone special! Purchase a gift card for The Timewalk Exhibition <a href=\"https://feverup.com/m/659923\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br>\r\n❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a href=\"https://timewalkexhibition.com/london/#faqs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br>\r\n👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 For groups of 20 people or more, please book your tickets via our <a href=\"https://timewalkexhibition.com/london/groups/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Groups Booking page</a>.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\r\nExperience <em>TIMEWALK</em> at Immerse LDN, the UK’s most spectacular immersive journey through human history. Spanning 12,000 years and 21 ancient civilisations, this large-scale experience combines breathtaking cinematic environments, spectacular projection technology, spatial sound and powerful storytelling.<br>\r\nBecome a Timewalker and journey through five defining chapters of civilisation: the Maya, Babylon, Ancient Egypt, Rapa Nui and Göbeklitepe. Walk through ancient cities, sail the Nile at sunset, pass beneath the legendary Ishtar Gate and witness the beliefs, innovations and monuments that shaped the modern world.<br>\r\nMore than an exhibition, <em>TIMEWALK</em> is a deeply human story of memory, legacy and connection across time. Designed for families, cultural explorers, history lovers and immersive experience enthusiasts alike, it blends education, entertainment and wonder into one of London’s most extraordinary cultural attractions.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nGet your tickets now for <em>Timewalk </em>at Immerse LDN in London!</div>",
